#: ../../source/libraries/data/index.md:3
msgid ""
"**miniworlds-data** provides animated data-structure visualizations built"
" on top of miniworlds. Each world renders one data structure and exposes "
"high-level operations so algorithm implementations stay readable; the "
"visualization is a side-effect of calling the operations."
